# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of the checking-out
# platform's core.autocrlf setting. This matters concretely for
# infra/backend/user-data.sh: infra/backend/04-launch-instance.sh passes
# it to `aws ec2 run-instances --user-data file://...` verbatim, and a
# CRLF shebang/script breaks under cloud-init on the Linux instance.
*.sh text eol=lf
